This repository is the reserved product home of Libre AI Notebook. It contains
no application and no product runtime code: active development happens in the
canonical base repository, and what lives here is the product brief, the
roadmap, the governance files and the forge configuration.

The licence for each file is declared through REUSE.toml:

- CC-BY-4.0: the bilingual README, the roadmap, the security and contribution
  policies and the readiness records under `docs/` — editorial documentation and
  first-party project records;
- EUPL-1.2: the files under `.github/` and `.gitignore`, first-party software by
  default.

Full licence texts are stored in LICENSES/.

The organization-wide licensing policy — scope, precedence, historical grants,
data and contribution rules — is the canonical one and is not restated here:
https://github.com/libre-ai/libre-ai/blob/main/LICENSING.md

Historical revisions previously published under MIT remain available under those
terms. No previous licence grant is withdrawn.
